flowchart TB
accTitle: One private database path, two DynamoDB paths
accDescr: A VPC-connected Lambda function reaches Neptune privately and can reach DynamoDB either through a gateway endpoint or through NAT egress.
subgraph VPC[Customer VPC]
  L[Lambda, private subnet]:::inputData
  N[Neptune query endpoint]:::storage
  GW[DynamoDB gateway endpoint]
  NAT[Public NAT + internet gateway]
  L -->|database port, SG allowed| N
  L -->|route to service prefix list| GW
  L -->|alternative IPv4 egress| NAT
end
GW --> DDB[DynamoDB]:::storage
NAT --> DDB
